#: scenario6:scenario6_AB61422F_38F0_4498_9F59_6F580BBF1977
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 13bc99298fd62577f7088c3efc458b4fb3dccef7c87d2b9e16e88788844f400a
